+# Version Numbering Scheme
+
+This project uses **semantic versioning (semver)** for version numbering. Versions follow the MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH format, where MAJOR indicates breaking changes, MINOR indicates backward-compatible functionality additions, and PATCH indicates backward-compatible bug fixes.
